    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your house, cultivate your greenhouses, raise wild-caught animals, and build your electrical installations. Your base will be the headquarters of your future attacks, as you conquer, you will unlock new skills to improve and expand it.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/73c8193e6959e418b39eba4b452adeba.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack your enemies' bases alone or with up to 4 people. Each base has a new mechanic to understand to conquer it, and offers you new skills to face the next one, or take care of your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/d8b8ec741171232f2e6f8abeb61f7937.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the sea, the mountains, the snow-capped peaks and the deserted islands, hunt animals with a bow or by hand, catch fish and harvest natural resources,\u00a0study species of birds and fish, find underwater wrecks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/9b85a4dbdab742f091425a44d4c81b47.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dominate the zones, you will be able to explore new skill areas, hunting, fishing, archery, logging, improving your boat and your sailing skills. You will improve your knowledge of electricity, animal breeding, and of course botany. Your goal here is to master the local flora and its specificities, sensitivity to the sun, temperature, consumption of water, fertilizer, to feed you, your animals or treat yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/eb606ea3b86d2f02a4a542fad1fefc97.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your house, cultivate your greenhouses, raise wild-caught animals, and build your electrical installations. Your base will be the headquarters of your future attacks, as you conquer, you will unlock new skills to improve and expand it.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/73c8193e6959e418b39eba4b452adeba.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquest</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack your enemies' bases alone or with up to 4 people. Each base has a new mechanic to understand to conquer it, and offers you new skills to face the next one, or take care of your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/d8b8ec741171232f2e6f8abeb61f7937.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the sea, the mountains, the snow-capped peaks and the deserted islands, hunt animals with a bow or by hand, catch fish and harvest natural resources,\u00a0study species of birds and fish, find underwater wrecks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/9b85a4dbdab742f091425a44d4c81b47.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dominate the zones, you will be able to explore new skill areas, hunting, fishing, archery, logging, improving your boat and your sailing skills. You will improve your knowledge of electricity, animal breeding, and of course botany. Your goal here is to master the local flora and its specificities, sensitivity to the sun, temperature, consumption of water, fertilizer, to feed you, your animals or treat yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729140/extras/eb606ea3b86d2f02a4a542fad1fefc97.avif?t=1733094487\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Saffron is an open world game of exploration, conquest, farming and navigation. Explore the territories of the Saint-Valentin archipelago alone or with friends by sail and carry out attacks against enemy bases, while building your own, sailing along the land.",
